#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:45
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is my life.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王是我的生命。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SophiaIntro"
msgid ""
"When I heard there was a strange\n"
"house, I had to check it out.$"
msgstr ""
"听说有间奇怪的房子，\n"
"我就一定要来看看。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SophiaDefeat"
msgid "I've discovered a tough TRAINER!$"
msgstr "我发现了一位强大的训练家！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:59
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SophiaPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I'm sure having a good time checking\n"
"this place out.\p"
"It's a challenge I've found worth\n"
"repeating!$"
msgstr ""
"在这里探索真是太开心了。\p"
"这是值得反复挑战的地方！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:65
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_BennyIntro"
msgid ""
"Maybe I could get my BIRD POKéMON\n"
"to fly over the wall…$"
msgstr ""
"也许我可以让我的\n"
"鸟宝可梦飞过这堵墙……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:69
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_BennyDefeat"
msgid "Gwaaah! I blew it!$"
msgstr "呜哇啊！搞砸了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:72
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_BennyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Ehehehe… I guess I lost because\n"
"I was trying to cheat.$"
msgstr ""
"嘿嘿嘿……我想我会输，\n"
"是因为我想作弊吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:76
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SebastianIntro"
msgid ""
"I'm getting dizzy from these rotating\n"
"doors…$"
msgstr "这些旋转门转得我头都晕了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:80
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SebastianDefeat"
msgid ""
"Everything's spinning around and\n"
"around. I can't take this anymore…$"
msgstr "一切都在转啊转。我受不了了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle6_Text_SebastianPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You don't seem to be affected at all.\n"
"Or do you have your poker face on?$"
msgstr ""
"你好像一点都没受影响。\n"
"还是说你只是面不改色？$"
